Wordsearch-Creator

Project Architecture & Stack
Core Build Tool: Vite (fast local development, optimal production bundling).

PWA Layer: Web App Manifest (manifest.json) and a Service Worker utilizing the Cache API for offline capabilities and installability.

Hosting: GitHub Pages (static asset deployment via GitHub Actions).

PDF Generation: jsPDF (or modern print stylesheets) to handle multi-page layout generation for both the puzzle sheet and the solution key.

Modular Code Structure: Separation of concerns between the Generator Engine (pure algorithmic logic), State Management, UI Rendering/Interaction, and PWA/Export Modules.

Core Algorithmic Plan
Grid Sizing & Validation: Clean input processing (uppercase conversion, duplicate removal, length filtering), followed by dynamic sizing calculations based on the longest word and total letter count.

Placement Engine: Implementation of backtracking or randomized directional placement (Horizontal, Vertical, Diagonal, and their respective reverses) with intersection tracking.

Matrix Fill & State Separation: Filling empty cells with pseudo-random alphabet characters while maintaining a clean, immutable reference data model for the solution key coordinates.

Interactivity & PWA: Touch/mouse drag-selection for word hunting, live validation, state persistence, and offline caching.


